{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark forces threaten the peaceful realm of Valora, and its villages cry out for protection. Answer the call as a legendary hero tasked with defending the realm's most vulnerable settlements. In this strategic turn-based deck-building game, your decisions will determine the fate of countless lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/Forests.gif?t=1744668768\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STRATEGIC DEPTH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct powerful structures, from mighty towers to specialized resource buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy and command diverse troops with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage crucial resources including Wood, Stone, Iron, and Gold to fund your defensive efforts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DECK-BUILDING MASTERY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your perfect deck through strategic card acquisition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powerful new buildings, troops, and abilities as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover synergistic combinations that enhance your defensive capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your strategy with specialized cards that complement your chosen hero's strengths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/Build.gif?t=1744668768\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> EPIC JOURNEY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate  your path through different villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face increasingly challenging threats as you venture deeper into corrupted territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront and defeat powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/Attack.gif?t=1744668768\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough offers unique challenges and opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple viable strategies for victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progressive difficulty scaling that tests your mastery of game mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3341630?t=1744668768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744668768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/5e503adde22faf3205a0d9abe16549b58377d977/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744668768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/5e503adde22faf3205a0d9abe16549b58377d977/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744668768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3538650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark forces threaten the peaceful realm of Valora, and its villages cry out for protection. Answer the call as a legendary hero tasked with defending the realm's most vulnerable settlements. In this strategic turn-based deck-building game, your decisions will determine the fate of countless lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/Forests.gif?t=1744668768\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STRATEGIC DEPTH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct 